  "schema": "openprose.quoted-strings/1",
  "summary": "How both ports quote a user-supplied value inside a reason or message: JSON string escaping, plus \\u escapes for DEL, C1 controls and invisible format, bidi and tag characters, so a quoted value can never reorder or hide text. Astral characters are escaped as a UTF-16 surrogate pair. A human Detail line renders a reason without doubling the backslashes of its quoted values; raw control characters are still made visible.",
